  "releaseNotes": "Aligns the CLIs to the current engine generation: PhoenixmlDb.Xslt 1.4.9, PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.5, PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9. The xquery CLI's attribute serialization now routes through the shared PhoenixmlDb.Xdm.Serialization.CharacterEscaper, so attribute-value whitespace (tab/newline/carriage-return) is emitted as numeric character references and the CLI output matches the engine library exactly. Picks up the engine-side serialization consolidation (XSLT 1.4.9, XQuery 1.4.5). See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
